Package: flaresync
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libssl3 | libssl3t64 | libssl1.1, ca-certificates
Homepage: https://github.com/gustavorviana/FlareSync
Description: Modular dynamic DNS client
 FlareSync detects the public IPv4/IPv6 address of the host and keeps DNS
 records up to date at Cloudflare, No-IP or any DynDNS2-compatible service.
 Installs and starts the "flaresync" systemd service, running as the
 "flaresync" system user with its configuration in /opt/flaresync/config.
